From 1b5ab80048d890f41fb0472a1e41bfa60bcdf61b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hummingbird <hummingbird@redhat.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 11:08:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Sync go.mod/go.sum with go-vendor-tools.toml pre_commands

go-vendor-tools.toml's [archive] pre_commands mutate go.mod before the vendor archive is generated, but those commands only run against the fetch/vendor checkout, not the actual %prep source tree. This patch captures the resulting go.mod and go.sum so the build tree agrees with vendor/modules.txt in hermetic builds.

